ependency outcome, while outcome_006 feature_052 within feature_002=1 tests whether the feature_052 signal seen for outcome_014 has a companion effect for outcome_006. Next analyses should prioritize these direct subgroup effects and the untested broad screens H25-H31/H33-H35/H36, but I will remain cautious with multiplicity and will not accept subgroup-specific effects unless the point estimates are clinically meaningful and, ideally, directionally replicated.",
