ndependent validation budget is exhausted, the most informative next analysis is H178, a formal feature_006 by feature_060 interaction within feature_002=1 for outcome_014, to test whether the strong H168 localization reflects effect modification. Secondary internal follow-ups are H179, H180, and optionally H175. Same-direction clinically sized results would support dataset-specific refinements; opposite or null results should close the leads.",
